    {"Each internal FSR4 preset is tuned for a specific resolution. Selecting an FSR4 preset won't change the in-game upscaler preset!!! Preset 0 is meant for FSR Native AA Preset 1 is meant for Quality/Ultra Quality Preset 2 is meant for Balanced Preset 3 is meant for Performance Preset 4 is meant for DRS Preset 5 is meant for Ultra Performance", {"Cada preajuste interno FSR4 corresponde a una resoluci\303\263n; elegirlo NO cambia el preajuste del juego. 0: FSR Native AA; 1: calidad/ultracalidad; 2: equilibrado; 3: rendimiento; 4: DRS; 5: ultrarrendimiento.", "Chaque pr\303\251r\303\251glage interne FSR4 vise une r\303\251solution ; il NE change PAS celui du jeu. 0 : FSR Native AA ; 1 : Qualit\303\251/Ultra qualit\303\251 ; 2 : \303\211quilibr\303\251 ; 3 : Performance ; 4 : DRS ; 5 : Ultra performance.", "Jede interne FSR4-Voreinstellung ist f\303\274r eine Aufl\303\266sung gedacht; sie \303\244ndert NICHT die Spieleinstellung. 0: FSR Native AA; 1: Qualit\303\244t/Ultra-Qualit\303\244t; 2: Ausgewogen; 3: Leistung; 4: DRS; 5: Ultra-Leistung.", "Cada predefini\303\247\303\243o interna FSR4 visa uma resolu\303\247\303\243o; ela N\303\203O muda a predefini\303\247\303\243o do jogo. 0: FSR Native AA; 1: qualidade/ultraqualidade; 2: equilibrado; 3: desempenho; 4: DRS; 5: ultradesempenho."}},
    {"Each render preset has it strengths and weaknesses Override to potentially improve image quality Press Apply after enable/disable", {"Cada preajuste tiene ventajas e inconvenientes. Sustituirlo puede mejorar la imagen. Pulsa Aplicar tras activarlo o desactivarlo.", "Chaque pr\303\251r\303\251glage a ses avantages et limites. Le remplacer peut am\303\251liorer l'image. Cliquez sur Appliquer apr\303\250s activation ou d\303\251sactivation.", "Jede Voreinstellung hat St\303\244rken und Schw\303\244chen. \303\234berschreiben kann die Bildqualit\303\244t verbessern. Nach dem Umschalten Anwenden dr\303\274cken.", "Cada predefini\303\247\303\243o tem vantagens e limita\303\247\303\265es. Substitu\303\255-la pode melhorar a imagem. Pressione Aplicar ap\303\263s ativar ou desativar."}},
    {"Each render preset has it strengths and weaknesses Override to potentially improve image quality Press apply after enable/disable", {"Cada preajuste tiene ventajas e inconvenientes. Sustituirlo puede mejorar la imagen. Pulsa Aplicar tras activarlo o desactivarlo.", "Chaque pr\303\251r\303\251glage a ses avantages et limites. Le remplacer peut am\303\251liorer l'image. Cliquez sur Appliquer apr\303\250s activation ou d\303\251sactivation.", "Jede Voreinstellung hat St\303\244rken und Schw\303\244chen. \303\234berschreiben kann die Bildqualit\303\244t verbessern. Nach dem Umschalten Anwenden dr\303\274cken.", "Cada predefini\303\247\303\243o tem vantagens e limita\303\247\303\265es. Substitu\303\255-la pode melhorar a imagem. Pressione Aplicar ap\303\263s ativar ou desativar."}},
