    {"Meant for development purpose to test if writing a larger value to reactive mask, reduces ghosting.", {"Prueba de desarrollo: comprueba si aumentar la m\303\241scara reactiva reduce estelas.", "Test de d\303\251veloppement : v\303\251rifie si amplifier le masque r\303\251actif r\303\251duit les tra\303\256n\303\251es.", "Entwicklungstest: Pr\303\274ft, ob h\303\266here Werte in der reaktiven Maske Nachbilder reduzieren.", "Teste de desenvolvimento: verifica se aumentar a m\303\241scara reativa reduz rastros."}},
