    {"Use Depth Aware Sharpening (DAS) Depth-aware directional adaptive luma sharpener Smarter sharpening with less artifacts, but also heavier The farther away is the object, the more sharpening is applied", {"Nitidez DAS adaptada a profundidad, direcci\303\263n y luminancia. M\303\241s inteligente y con menos artefactos, pero m\303\241s pesada. Los objetos m\303\241s lejanos reciben m\303\241s nitidez.", "Nettet\303\251 DAS adapt\303\251e \303\240 la profondeur, \303\240 la direction et \303\240 la luminance. Plus intelligente, moins d'artefacts, mais plus co\303\273teuse. Les objets \303\251loign\303\251s sont davantage accentu\303\251s.", "DAS-Sch\303\244rfung ber\303\274cksichtigt Tiefe, Richtung und Luminanz. Intelligenter und artefakt\303\244rmer, aber aufwendiger. Weiter entfernte Objekte werden st\303\244rker gesch\303\244rft.", "Nitidez DAS adaptada \303\240 profundidade, dire\303\247\303\243o e lumin\303\242ncia. Mais inteligente e com menos artefatos, mas mais pesada. Objetos distantes recebem mais nitidez."}},
    {"Use Depth Aware Sharpening (RCAS) Smarter sharpening with less artifacts, but also heavier The farther away is the object, the more sharpening is applied", {"Nitidez RCAS adaptada a profundidad: menos artefactos, pero m\303\241s coste. Cuanto m\303\241s lejos el objeto, m\303\241s nitidez.", "Nettet\303\251 RCAS selon la profondeur : moins d'artefacts mais plus co\303\273teuse. Les objets \303\251loign\303\251s sont davantage accentu\303\251s.", "Tiefenabh\303\244ngige RCAS-Sch\303\244rfung: weniger Artefakte, aber h\303\266here Kosten. Entfernte Objekte werden st\303\244rker gesch\303\244rft.", "Nitidez RCAS adaptada \303\240 profundidade: menos artefatos, mas mais custo. Objetos distantes recebem mais nitidez."}},
